1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
And this is Live.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,500
When the real interview starts, MockMate keeps your resume,
job description, selected documents, playbook, and conversation close.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:16,500
It can help with follow-up questions, coding prompts,
and screen questions while you stay focused on the conversation.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:24,500
On Windows and macOS, content protection is available,
but always verify the actual Zoom, Meet, or Teams share preview.

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,500
Linux content protection is not supported.
